  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Radio Education - Promotion of Learning through Radio in Isolated Areas in Pakistan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims at enhancing access to schools, communities, and youth in isolated areas of Pakistan to improve learning opportunities through an Interactive Radio Instruction (IRI) Approach comprised of educational content and information on the tangible and intangible cultural heritage of Pakistan. The project caters to the learning needs of the 19 most marginalized and isolated districts of Pakistan, which are mostly deprived of digital technology and access to distance learning programs introduced by the Government during the COVID-19 period on television and radio.</narrative>
  </description>
